# One lockfile only. bun.lock pinned Lovable's private artifact registry
# (europe-west*-npm.pkg.dev), which 403s outside their sandbox and is why the
# build could not be reproduced. npm + package-lock.json is the source of truth;
# ignore a stray bun.lock so `bun install` cannot silently reintroduce it.
bun.lock
